et at $105^\\circ$. What is the area of $\\triangle DAB$, rounded to the **nearest integer**?\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator." :question/requires-calculator true :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $CDB$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDB}&=\\frac12\\cdot CD\\cdot CB\\cdot\\sin\\angle DCB\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 3.5\\cdot 9\\cdot\\sin105^\\circ\\\\&\\approx15.213332\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ and the missing triangle $DAB$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAB}&=A_{CDB}-A_{CDAB}\\\\&=15.75\\sin105^\\circ-4\\\\&\\approx11.213332\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $11\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186725360 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725425}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f49b2e33-0e31-5b95-984a-ecbe8d4919e4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725425} :answer-field/id #uuid "1131fa82-d326-588b-bd85-160a618b7cbf" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725358}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "1685cd79-f7c2-587f-ba69-54f57dab0b52" :question/problem "![Concave quadrilateral BCDA with measurements](images/c7/c715f2d6e3221f2061abe962c22fde1c08db8beccb1a5367cce1869aed7c1e3c.png)\n\nThe area of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ is $3\\,\\text{in}^{2}$. The sides $BC=7\\,\\text{in}$ and $BA=3.5\\,\\text{in}$ meet at $63^\\circ$. The area of $\\triangle CDA$, rounded to the **nearest integer**, is {{field-1}} $\\text{in}^{2}$.\n\nYou may use a scientific calculator." :question/requires-calculator true :question/worked-solution "First calculate the area of the enclosing triangle $BCA$. Use the two given sides and their included angle, with the calculator in degree mode.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{BCA}&=\\frac12\\cdot BC\\cdot BA\\cdot\\sin\\angle CBA\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 7\\cdot 3.5\\cdot\\sin63^\\circ\\\\&\\approx10.914830\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $BCDA$ and the missing triangle $CDA$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{CDA}&=A_{BCA}-A_{BCDA}\\\\&=12.25\\sin63^\\circ-3\\\\&\\approx7.914830\\,\\text{in}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $8\\,\\text{in}^{2}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186725361 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5df94a7d-d3d6-5a07-90ce-8740f5959801" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16\\,\\text{in}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725380} {:answer/id #uuid "6af99c8b-bc8d-5a28-8758-e330d70a9d4e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21\\,\\text{in}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725384} {:answer/id #uuid "76bbb6fd-169a-53f1-a58a-9e61783513f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8\\,\\text{in}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725388} {:answer/id #uuid "79c36293-2f8b-588f-9a2c-04d777e79822" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "24\\,\\text{in}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725390} {:answer/id #uuid "7d46abed-adfd-5b7a-93d4-ad2de4660aa4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11\\,\\text{in}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725