{aligned}A_{CDB}&=\\frac12\\cdot CD\\cdot CB\\cdot\\sin\\angle DCB\\\\&=\\frac12\\cdot 4\\cdot 10\\cdot\\sin105^\\circ\\\\&\\approx19.318517\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe enclosing triangle consists of the quadrilateral $CDAB$ and the missing triangle $DAB$. Subtract the quadrilateral area:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A_{DAB}&=A_{CDB}-A_{CDAB}\\\\&=20\\sin105^\\circ-5\\\\&\\approx14.318517\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nKeep full precision until this subtraction is complete. Rounded to the nearest integer, the area is $14\\,\\text{cm}^{2}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186725385 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "10573d25-6ac5-5d4c-9cca-e33686ef622c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17\\,\\text{cm}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725357} {:answer/id #uuid "6606d6f6-7acb-56cb-9467-d8a12c70f48d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12\\,\\text{cm}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725382} {:answer/id #uuid "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7\\,\\text{cm}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725391} {:answer/id #uuid "94fe0195-e8d3-5159-bfee-64e817951f9d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "19\\,\\text{cm}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725399} {:answer/id #uuid "ea5e63d9-c640-5fcb-b771-eea4e91af55e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5\\,\\text{cm}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725422}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7a536b20-74de-5bc7-be28-0923258ac870" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7\\,\\text{cm}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186725391} :answer-field/id #uuid "c02315a1-9030-5255-b417-97ce005002b6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218604